  {
   "t": "Most Black Friday deals… aren't actually deals.",
   "s": 0.05,
   "e": 2.67
  },
  {
   "t": "The UK consumer group Which? tracked Black Friday prices for months before and after the sale.",
   "s": 2.87,
   "e": 7.86
  },
  {
   "t": "In their twenty twenty-three study, ninety-two percent of deals were the same price, or cheaper, at other times of the year.",
